## 2. API ENDPOINTS

### Dispute Management

| Method | Path | Auth | Purpose |
|--------|------|------|---------|
| POST | `/disputes` | Buyer/Seller | Initiate a new dispute |
| GET | `/disputes/:id` | Buyer/Seller/Admin | View dispute details |
| GET | `/disputes` | Buyer/Seller/Admin | List user's disputes (filtered by role) |
| PATCH | `/disputes/:id/status` | Admin | Admin updates dispute status |
| POST | `/disputes/:id/submit-evidence` | Buyer/Seller | Submit evidence |
| GET | `/disputes/:id/evidence` | Buyer/Seller/Admin | List all evidence |
| DELETE | `/disputes/:id/evidence/:evidenceId` | Submitter/Admin | Delete evidence (within 24hrs) |
| POST | `/disputes/:id/message` | Buyer/Seller/Admin | Add message to timeline |
| POST | `/disputes/:id/resolve` | Admin | Admin proposes/forces resolution |
| POST | `/disputes/:id/appeal` | Respondent | Appeal a resolution |
| GET | `/disputes/:id/timeline` | Buyer/Seller/Admin | View dispute history |
| POST | `/disputes/:id/request-info` | Admin | Request more info from party |
| PATCH | `/disputes/:id` | Admin | Update dispute fields (reason, description) |
| GET | `/admin/disputes` | Admin | Dashboard: list all disputes with filters |
| GET | `/admin/disputes/stats` | Admin | Dashboard: stats (open count, avg resolution time) |

### Admin Dashboard

| Method | Path | Auth | Purpose |
|--------|------|------|---------|
| GET | `/admin/disputes?status=OPEN&sort=createdAt` | Admin | Paginated dispute list with filters |
| GET | `/admin/disputes/:id/full` | Admin | Full dispute with all relations (evidence, timeline) |
| POST | `/admin/disputes/:id/auto-close-trigger` | Service | Trigger auto-close job (scheduled) |

