## Summary

This specification provides a **production-ready, legally compliant audit system** for a real-estate marketplace. Key features:

✅ **Immutable, append-only audit log** (never update/delete)  
✅ **Auto-capture IP, User Agent** via middleware  
✅ **Before/after diffs** for all updates  
✅ **9+ audit endpoints** (list, filter, export, stats)  
✅ **Resource-specific audit trails** (transaction, property, connection, etc.)  
✅ **Async PDF/CSV export** with job queue  
✅ **Admin filtering** by user, action, date range  
✅ **Strict layering** (controller → service → repo → Prisma)  
✅ **Zero business logic in repo**  
✅ **Type-safe DTOs** with class-validator  

**Next step:** Create Prisma migration, test repository layer, then integrate with UserService.

